n></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-amber-400 font-bold\">✔</span><span class=\"text-slate-200\">対面座位で抱き合いながら「あなたの精子でいっぱいに満たして」と夫以外の男に中出しを懇願する禁断の濡れ場</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-amber-400 font-bold\">✔</span><span class=\"text-slate-200\">薄暗いホテルの間接照明が照らし出す艶やかな肌と、汗の滴る背中の陰影美が織りなす大人のエロティシズム</span></li>\n                </ul>\n              </div>\n\n              <div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 pt-2\">\n                <a href=\"/posts/adn00500\" class=\"flex-1 inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-3 bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 border border-slate-600/50 text-white font-bold rounded-xl transition text-sm gap-1.5\">\n                  <span>📖 個別詳細レビューを読む</span>\n                  <svg class=\"w-4 h-4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M9 5l7 7-7 7\"/></svg>\n                </a>\n                <a href=\"https://al.fanza.co.jp/?lurl=https%3A%2F%2Fvideo.dmm.co.jp%2Fav%2Fcontent%2F%3Fid%3Dadn00500&af_id=onchan555-003&ch=api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"flex-1 inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-3 bg-gradient-to-r from-rose-600 to-amber-500 hover:from-rose-500 hover:to-amber-400 text-white font-extrabold rounded-xl shadow-lg transition text-sm gap-1.5\">\n                  <span>🎬 公式で無料サンプルを見る</span>\n                  <svg class=\"w-4 h-4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3\"/></svg>\n                </a>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <!-- 作品紹介カード：第4位 -->\n        <div class=\"bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-3xl p-6 md:p-8 shadow-xl space-y-6\">\n          <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-6 items-center md:items-start\">\n          